{"speciesId":331,"names":{"fr":"Cacnea","es":"Cacnea","en":"Cacnea","ja":"サボネア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CACNEA lives in arid locations such as deserts. It releases a strong aroma from its flower to attract prey. When prey comes near, this POKéMON shoots sharp thorns from its body to bring the victim down."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The more arid and harsh the environment, the more pretty and fragrant a flower CACNEA grows. This POKéMON battles by wildly swinging its thorny arms."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"CACNEA live in deserts with virtually no rainfall. It battles by swinging its thick, spiked arms. Once a year, a yellow flower blooms."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En stockant l’eau dans son corps, cet habitant du désert peut survivre 30 jours sans boire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En stockant l’eau dans son corps, cet habitant du désert peut survivre 30 jours sans boire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Cacnea vit dans les zones arides. Une fois par an, une fleur jaune éclot sur sa tête."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en regiones secas y con pocas lluvias. Una vez al año, le brota una flor amarilla."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"雨が 少ない 乾燥した 地域に 生息。１年に １回 黄色の 花を 咲かせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se sent plus à l’aise dans des endroits hostiles comme le désert. Il peut survivre 30 jours en utilisant seulement l’eau stockée dans son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Prefiere los medios hostiles como los desiertos. Puede sobrevivir 30 días sin beber, gracias al agua que almacena."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"砂漠などの 過酷な 環境を 好む。 体の 中に たくわえた 水で ３０日間 生きられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cacnea vit dans les milieux arides, tels les déserts. Sa fleur libère un parfum entêtant pour attirer sa proie. Lorsqu’elle s’approche, ce Pokémon envoie des épines pour la neutraliser."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cacnea habita en desiertos y otras zonas áridas. Para atraer a su presa, libera un fuerte aroma por la flor y, cuando se le acerca, le lanza pinchos por todo el cuerpo para reducirla."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cacnea lives in arid locations such as deserts. It releases a strong aroma from its flower to attract prey. When prey comes near, this Pokémon shoots sharp thorns from its body to bring the victim down."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"砂漠 など 乾燥した 地域に 生息。 強い 花の 香りで 獲物を 誘い込み 鋭い 体の トゲを 飛ばして 仕留める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si son environnement est aride et difficile, la fleur de Cacnea devient plus jolie et dégage un parfum délicat. Ce Pokémon se bat en agitant ses bras épineux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuanto más árido y hostil sea el hábitat de Cacnea, más bonita y aromática será la flor que le crece. Este Pokémon lucha agitando violentamente los brazos cargados de pinchos que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The more arid and harsh the environment, the more pretty and fragrant a flower Cacnea grows. This Pokémon battles by wildly swinging its thorny arms."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"雨の 少ない 厳しい 環境 ほど きれいで 香りの 強い 花を 咲かせる。 トゲの ついた 腕を 振り回して 戦う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":331,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",17],[6,"level-up",17],[7,"level-up",17],[8,"level-up",17],[9,"level-up",17],[10,"level-up",17],[11,"level-up",17],[12,"level-up",17